t statuses"'=>'请选择“内容状态”的选项','Posts'=>'文章','Schedule'=>'调度','Metaboxes'=>'元框','Run Auto Terms button'=>'运行自动术语按钮','Show Run Auto Terms next to Add Post on the Posts screen. Runs this configuration on selected posts using its post settings, even when automatic processing on save is disabled.'=>'在帖子屏幕的“添加帖子”旁边显示运行自动术语。即使在保存时禁用自动处理，也会根据所选帖子的设置运行此配置。','Enable Auto Terms when a post is saved or updated.'=>'在保存或更新帖子时启用自动术语。','Auto Terms Limit'=>'自动术语限制','Limit the number of generated Auto Terms. \'0\' for unlimited terms'=>'限制生成的自动术语数量。\'0\' 表示无限术语','Target content'=>'目标内容','Only use Auto Terms on posts with no added terms.'=>'仅在没有添加术语的帖子上使用自动术语。','Whole words'=>'完整单词','Only add terms when the word is an exact match. Do not make matches for partial words.'=>'仅在单词完全匹配时添加术语。不要对部分单词进行匹配。','Hashtags'=>'标签','Support hashtags symbols # in Auto Terms.'=>'支持自动术语中的标签符号 #。','Auto Terms replacement settings'=>'自动术语替换设置','This option determines what happens when adding new terms to posts.'=>'此选项决定在帖子中添加新术语时发生什么。','Enable Auto Terms for the "Schedule" feature.'=>'为 "计划" 功能启用自动术语。','Only use Auto Terms on schedules with no added terms.'=>'仅在没有添加术语的日程上使用自动术语。','Enable Auto Terms for the "Existing Content" feature.'=>'为 "现有内容" 功能启用自动术语。','Enable Auto Terms for the "Metaboxes" and the "Fast Update" feature.'=>'为 "元框" 和 "快速更新" 功能启用自动术语。','Existing Terms requires the term name to appear in the selected content. AI sources can suggest terms without an exact text match.'=>'现有术语要求术语名称出现在所选内容中。AI 源可以建议没有精确文本匹配的术语。','Existing Terms'=>'现有术语','Add existing terms from the taxonomy selected on the General tab when their names match the content.'=>'当现有术语的名称与内容匹配时，从常规选项卡中所选的分类法添加现有术语。','Use all the terms in the selected taxonomy.'=>'使用所选分类法中的所有术语。','Use only some terms in the selected taxonomy.'=>'仅使用所选分类法中的某些术语。','Please choose an option for "Sources"'=>'请选择 "来源" 的选项','Choose the terms to use'=>'选择要使用的术语','Choose the terms to use.'=>'选择要使用的术语。','Show Term Post Count'=>'显示术语帖子计数','This will show the n