d not be copied. Please try again.'=>'无法复制调试信息。请再试一次。','Save Auto Terms'=>'保存自动术语','Add Auto Terms'=>'添加自动术语','Auto Terms Existing'=>'自动术语已存在','An error occured.'=>'发生错误。','Auto Terms Existing Content'=>'自动术语现有内容','This feature can scan your existing content and automatically assign new and existing terms.'=>'此功能可以扫描您现有的内容并自动分配新的和现有的术语。','Select an option...'=>'选择一个选项...','Auto Terms setting'=>'自动术语设置','Select an Auto Terms configuration to use when scanning content.'=>'选择一个自动术语配置以在扫描内容时使用。','This enables you to add Terms to existing content in batches. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'这使您能够批量将术语添加到现有内容中。如果您有大量现有内容，请将此设置为更低的数字以避免超时。','This setting allows you to add Terms only to recent content.'=>'此设置允许您仅将术语添加到最近的内容。','Save Settings'=>'保存设置','Results'=>'结果','You can see full log details on the %1s screen'=>'您可以在 %1s 屏幕上查看完整的日志详细信息','Tag Cloud'=>'标签云','Tags Cloud'=>'标签云','Select all terms'=>'选择所有术语','Name'=>'名称','Slug'=>'Slug','Count'=>'计数','No term avaliable.'=>'没有可用的术语。','Select term %s'=>'选择术语 %s','Taxonomies'=>'Taxonomies','Registration key'=>'注册密钥','Description'=>'描述','Active'=>'激活','Order'=>'顺序','Edited'=>'已编辑','No taxonomies found.'=>'未找到分类法。','View'=>'查看','WordPress core'=>'WordPress 核心','PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies','A readable CSV stream is required.'=>'需要可读的 CSV 流。','The CSV file could not be read.'=>'无法读取 CSV 文件。','The CSV file exceeds the 5 MiB import limit.'=>'CSV 文件超过 5 MiB 导入限制。','CSV record 1 contains invalid TaxoPress transfer metadata.'=>'CSV 记录 1 包含无效的 TaxoPress 转移元数据。','This CSV was exported for taxonomy "%1$s" and post type "%2$s". Change the selection to match before importing.'=>'此 CSV 是为分类法 "%1$s" 和帖子类型 "%2$s" 导出的。在导入之前，请更改选择以匹配。','CSV record %d must contain slug,name,description and may also contain post_ids or parent_slug,post_ids.'=>'CSV 记录 %d 必须包含 slug,name,description，并且还可以包含 post_ids 或 parent_slug,post_ids。','Column count must match the header exactly.'=>'列数必须与标题完全匹配。','CSV records cannot contain more than five columns.'=>'CSV 记录不能包含超过五列。','The CSV file exceeds the 5,000-term import limit.'=>'CSV 文件超过 5,000 个术语的导入限制。','Malformed CSV quoting.'=>'CSV 引号格式错误。','Unclosed quoted CSV field.'=>'未闭合的引号 CSV 字段。','Import requires an array of no more than 5,000 terms.'=>'导入要求不超过 5,000 个术语的数组。','Each term must have string slug, name, and description fields.'=>'每个术语必须具有字符串 slug、name 和 description 字段。','Fields must contain valid UTF-8 without null bytes.'=>'字段必须包含有效的 UTF-8 字符串且不能有空字节。','Name and slug must be nonempty and usable.'=>'名称和 slug 必须非空且可用。','Name and slug must each be at most 200 bytes; values are not truncated.'=>'名称和 slug 每个最多 200 字节；值不会被截断。','Description must be at most 10,000 bytes.'=>'描述最多只能为 10,000 字节。','Slug must already be a canonical WordPress slug and cannot be "0".'=>'Slug 必须是一个规范的 WordPress slug，且不能为 "0"。','Duplicate slug; first used in CSV record %d.'=>'重复的 slug；首次在 CSV 记录 %d 中使用。','parent_slug must be a string.'=>'parent_slug 必须是一个字符串。','parent_slug can only be used with a hierarchical taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug 只能与层级 taxonomy 一起使用。','parent_slug must be a different canonical WordPress slug.'=>'parent_slug 必须是一个不同的规范 WordPress slug。','parent_slug must identify a term in this CSV file or an existing term in the selected taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug 必须标识此 CSV 文件中的一个术语或所选 taxonomy 中的一个现有术语。','Term parent relationships cannot contain a cycle.'=>'术语父级关系不能包含循环。','You do not have permission to assign terms in the selected taxonomy. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'您没有权限在所选 taxonomy 中分配术语。没有写入任何术语或分配。','The file exceeds the 25,000 term-to-content assignment import limit.'=>'文件超过 25,000 个术语到内容分配的导入限制。','You do not have permission to edit content ID %d. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'您没有权限编辑内容 ID %d。没有写入任何术语或分配。','The selected taxonomy is unavailable.'=>'所选 taxonomy 不可用。','The selected post type is unavailable or does not support the selected taxonomy.'=>'所选 post type 不可用或不支持所选 taxonomy。','post_ids must be a 