：22）','Unit font size:'=>'单位字体大小：','Point (default)'=>'磅（默认）','Pixel'=>'像素','Em'=>'Em','Pourcent'=>'百分比','Format:'=>'格式：','Flat (default)'=>'平面（默认）','List (UL/LI)'=>'列表（UL/LI）','Ordinary List (OL/LI)'=>'普通列表 (OL/LI)','Use auto color cloud:'=>'使用自动颜色云：','Font color mini: (default: #CCCCCC)'=>'字体颜色迷你：(默认：#CCCCCC)','Font color max: (default: #000000)'=>'字体颜色最大：(默认：#000000)','Tag link format:'=>'标签链接格式：','Advanced usage:'=>'高级用法：','What to show'=>'显示内容','PublishPress Taxonomies Logo'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 徽标','Welcome to PublishPress Taxonomies, the WordPress taxonomy plugin'=>'欢迎使用 PublishPress Taxonomies，WordPress 分类法插件','This screen allows you to enable or disable PublishPress Taxonomies features.'=>'此屏幕允许您启用或禁用 PublishPress Taxonomies 功能。','This feature allows you to create new taxonomies and edit all the settings for each taxonomy.'=>'此功能允许您创建新的taxonomies并编辑每个taxonomy的所有设置。','This feature allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'此功能允许您搜索和编辑您网站上的所有术语。','This feature allows you to search for terms and see all the posts attached to that term.'=>'此功能允许您搜索术语并查看与该术语关联的所有文章。','Terms Display'=>'条款显示','This feature allows you to create a customizable display of all the terms in one taxonomy.'=>'此功能允许您创建一个可自定义的显示，展示一个分类法中的所有术语。','Terms for Current Post'=>'当前文章的术语','This feature allows you create a customizable display of all the terms assigned to the current post.'=>'此功能允许您创建一个可自定义的当前文章所有分配术语的显示。','This feature creates a display of similar posts. If a post has the terms “WordPress” and “Website”, Related Posts will display other posts with those same terms.'=>'此功能创建类似文章的显示。如果一篇文章具有“WordPress”和“网站”这两个术语，相关文章将显示其他具有相同术语的文章。','This feature automatically adds links to your chosen terms. If you have a term called “WordPress”, Auto Links finds the word “WordPress” in your content and add links to the archive page for that term.'=>'此功能会自动添加您选择的术语链接。如果您有一个名为“WordPress”的术语，自动链接会在您的内容中找到“WordPress”一词，并添加指向该术语的归档页面的链接。','This feature allows you to quickly edit the terms attached to multiple posts at the same time.'=>'此功能允许您快速编辑同时附加到多个文章的术语。','This feature allows you to add, rename, merge, and delete terms for any taxonomy.'=>'此功能允许您为任何分类法添加、重命名、合并和删除术语。','Show All Existing Terms'=>'显示所有现有术语','Manage Post Terms'=>'管理帖子术语','Create Terms'=>'创建术语','This post type has no taxonomies.'=>'此文章类型没有分类法。','%1s Metabox'=>'%1s 元框','Enable the metabox on the %1s screen.'=>'在 %1s 屏幕上启用元框。','Metabox Features'=>'元框功能','Show Private Taxonomies'=>'显示私有分类法','Add support for private taxonomies.'=>'为私有分类法添加支持。','Default Taxonomy'=>'默认分类法','%1s Metabox Filters'=>'%1s 元框过滤器','Enable filters in the %1s existing terms tab.'=>'在 %1s 现有术语标签中启用过滤器。','Default Method for choosing terms'=>'选择术语的默认方法','Default Ordering for choosing terms'=>'选择术语的默认排序','Default maximum terms'=>'默认最大术语','Metabox Show Term Post Count'=>'元框显示术语文章计数','Show Term Slug'=>'显示术语别名','Minimum term length'=>'最小术语长度','Specify the minimum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'创建术语时指定新术语的最小长度。','Maximum term length'=>'最大术语长度','Specify the maximum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'创建术语时指定新术语的最大长度。','Prohibited Characters'=>'禁止字符','Enter characters that will be blocked when users add new terms inside the "Create Terms" box. For example: !@#$%&*()'=>'输入在用户添加新术语时将被阻止的字符，例如：!@#$%&*()','Allow users in the %1s role to use the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'允许 %1s 角色的用户使用 PublishPress Taxonomies 元框。','Block Users from Creating New Terms'=>'阻止用户创建新术语','Prevent users in the %1$s role from creating new terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'防止 %1$s 角色的用户在 PublishPress Taxonomies 元框中创建新术语。','Taxonomies in Metabox'=>'Metabox中的Taxonomies','Select the taxonomies that users in %1s role can manage in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'选择%1s角色的用户可以在PublishPress Taxonomies metabox中管理的分类法。','Remove Default Metaboxes'=>'移除默认Metabox','Remove default taxonomy metaboxes for users in the %1s role.'=>'移除%1s角色用户的默认分类法metabox。','These settings control features on the Posts screen.'=>'这些设置控制帖子屏幕上的功能。','Terms Filter display:'=>'术语过滤器显示：','Term Name'=>'术语名称','Term Name + Taxonomy Name'=>'术语名称 + 分类法名称','Term Name + Taxonomy Slug'=>'术语名称 + 分类法别名','This controls the details that appear in the "Terms Filter" display and can help if you have terms with similar names.'=>'这控制在“术语过滤器”显示中出现的详细信息，并且可以帮助您处理名称相似的术语。','Terms Filter taxonomy:'=>'术语过滤器分类法：','Public Taxonomies'=>'公共Taxonomies','Private Taxonomies'=>'私有Taxonomies','Public Taxonomies and Private Taxonomies'=>'公共分类法和私有分类法','This controls the taxonomy terms that appear on the "Posts" screen.'=>'这控制在“帖子”屏幕上出现的分类法术语。','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the primary or secondary term is added to a post, the other term can be added also.'=>'此功能允许您连接术语。当主术语或次要术语被添加到帖子时，另一个术语也可以被添加。','Linked Terms Type:'=>'链接术语类型：','2-way relationship. When the main term or secondary term are added to the post, other term will be added also.'=>'双向关系。当主术语或次要术语被添加到帖子时，另一个术语也将被添加。','Add the primary term, get the secondary term'=>'添加主术语，获取次要术语','Add the secondary term, get the primary term.'=>'添加次要术语，获取主术语。','Enable Taxonomies:'=>'启用分类法：','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Linked Terms feature.'=>'这控制链接术语功能可用的分类法。','This feature allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'此功能允许您将多个词与单个术语关联。如果PublishPress Taxonomies扫描您的内容并找到同义词，它将像找到主术语一样处理。','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Term Synonyms feature.'=>'这控制术语同义词功能可用的分类法。','Enable Hidden Terms:'=>'启用隐藏术语：','This feature will hide terms that are infrequently used. These terms will be visible inside the WordPress admin area, but not on the front of this site.'=>'此功能将隐藏使用频率不高的术语。这些术语将在WordPress管理区域中可见，但不会在本站前端显示。','Minimum Usage for Hidden Terms:'=>'隐藏术语的最小使用量：','Set the minimum number of posts a term must be attached to. If you enter 5, any term used in fewer than 5 posts will be hidden across the site, and its archive page will redirect to the homepage.'=>'设置术语必须附加的帖子最小数量。如果您输入5，任何在少于5个帖子中使用的术语将在站点上被隐藏，其归档页面将重定向到主页。','PublishPress Taxonomies loads CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend for features like Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post. If you disable these scripts, those features may not display correctly.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies在前端加载CSS和JavaScript文件，以实现术语显示、相关帖子和当前帖子术语等功能。如果您禁用这些脚本，这些功能可能无法正确显示。','Disable Frontend Scripts:'=>'禁用前端脚本：','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend of your site.'=>'选中此项以防止PublishPress Taxonomies在您站点的前端加载CSS和JavaScript文件。','Disable Admin Preview Scripts:'=>'禁用管理预览脚本：','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading frontend CSS and JavaScript files in the WordPress admin area. This will break the preview functionality when editing Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post.'=>'选中此项以防止PublishPress Taxonomies在WordPress管理区域加载前端CSS和JavaScript文件。这将破坏编辑术语显示、相关帖子和当前帖子术语时的预览功能。','These settings control features on the Manage Terms screen.'=>'这些设置控制管理术语屏幕上的功能。','Add Terms:'=>'添加术语：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while adding terms'=>'启用此选项将允许用户在添加术语时看到别名','Remove Terms:'=>'移除术语：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while removing terms'=>'启用此选项将允许用户在移除术语时看到别名','Rename Terms:'=>'重命名术语：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while Renaming terms'=>'启用此选项将允许用户在重命名术语时看到别名','Merge Terms:'=>'合并术语：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while merging terms'=>'启用此选项将允许用户在合并术语时看到别名','Mass Edit Terms:'=>'批量编辑术语：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug in the Mass Edit Terms screen'=>'启用此功能将允许用户在批量编辑术语屏幕中查看别名','No tags for this post.'=>'此帖没有标签。','<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
			                       %post_title% <br> 
			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)'=>'<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
			                       %post_title% <br> 
			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)','<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>'=>'<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>','Shortcode entry successfully deleted.'=>'短代码条目已成功删除。','Invalid post terms ID.'=>'无效的帖子术语 ID。','Automatic display'=>'自动显示','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Current Post'=>'当前帖子','Add New Terms for Current Post'=>'为当前帖子添加新术语','Search Terms for Current Post'=>'为当前帖子搜索术语','Manage Terms for Current Post'=>'管理当前帖子的术语','Preview Terms for Current Post'=>'预览当前帖子的术语','Toggle panel'=>'切换面板','Edit Terms for Current Post'=>'编辑当前帖子的术语','Add new Terms for Current Post'=>'为当前帖子添加新术语','To create more Terms for Current Post, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'要为当前帖子创建更多术语，请升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms for Current Post. You can create Terms for Current Post for any taxonomy and then display those Terms for Current Post anywhere on your site.'=>'使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以为当前帖子创建无限的术语。您可以为任何分类法创建当前帖子的术语，然后在您网站的任何地方显示这些术语。','Choose Terms'=>'选择术语','Display'=>'显示','Layout'=>'布局','Design'=>'设计','Display Format'=>'显示格式','24 hours'=>'24小时','7 days'=>'7天','2 weeks'=>'2 周','1 month'=>'1 个月','6 months'=>'6 个月','1 year'=>'1 年','Limit terms based on timeframe'=>'根据时间范围限制术语','Order direction'=>'排序方向','Font size minimum'=>'字体大小最小值','Font size maximum'=>'字体大小最大值','Point'=>'点','Percent'=>'百分比','Unit font size'=>'单位字体大小','Enable colors for terms'=>'为术语启用颜色','Font color minimum'=>'字体颜色最小值','This is the color of the least popular term.'=>'这是最不受欢迎的术语的颜色。','Font color maximum'=>'字体颜色最大值','This is the color of the most popular term.'=>'这是最受欢迎的术语的颜色。','Attempt to automatically display terms'=>'尝试自动显示术语','PublishPress Taxonomies will attempt to automatically display terms in this content. It may not be successful for all post types and layouts.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 将尝试在此内容中自动显示术语。对于所有帖子类型和布局，它可能不成功。','Above post content'=>'帖子内容上方','Below post content'=>'帖子内容下方','Automatic display position'=>'自动显示位置','Choose whether automatically displayed terms appear above or below the post content.'=>'选择自动显示的术语是出现在帖子内容上方还是下方。','Maximum terms to display'=>'最大显示术语数量','You must set zero (0) to display all post tags.'=>'您必须设置为零（0）以显示所有帖子标签。','Post term separator string:	'=>'帖子术语分隔字符串：	','Text to display before terms list'=>'术语列表前显示的文本','Enter the text that should be display before terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'输入应该在术语列表前显示的文本。该字段接受基本的 HTML。','Text to display after terms list'=>'术语列表后显示的文本','Enter the text that should be display after terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'输入应该在术语列表后显示的文本。该字段接受基本的 HTML。','Text to display if no terms found'=>'如果未找到术语则显示的文本','Hide display output if no terms ?'=>'如果没有术语则隐藏显示输出？','Terms for Current Post div class'=>'当前帖子术语 div 类','Term link format'=>'术语链接格式','You can use any of the tokens shown below or find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'您可以使用下面显示的任何令牌或在文档中找到更多详细信息 %1$s%2$s。','Here are the tokens you can use for Terms for Current Post format'=>'以下是您可以用于当前帖子术语格式的令牌','The URL of the tag'=>'标签的 URL','The name of the tag'=>'标签的名称','This provides rel tag markup'=>'这提供了 rel 标签标记','it creates'=>'它创建','Replaced by the RSS tag link'=>'被 RSS 标签链接替代','Replaced by the tag ID'=>'被标签 ID 替代','Replaced by the tag’s name, formatted for attribute HTML'=>'被标签名称替代，格式化为属性 HTML','The description of the tag'=>'标签的描述','The font size of the tag'=>'标签的字体大小','The font color of the tag'=>'标签的字体颜色','You can also add HTML elements to the formatting.'=>'您还可以将 HTML 元素添加到格式中。','Exclude hidden terms from Current Post?'=>'从当前帖子中排除隐藏的术语？','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free.
                                            The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'您正在使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Free。专业版有更多功能和支持。','Save Terms for Current Post'=>'保存当前帖子的术语','Add Terms for Current Post'=>'为当前帖子添加术语','Shortcode: '=>'短代码: ','No terms found for this post.'=>'未找到此帖子的术语。','Post Status'=>'帖子状态','Author'=>'作者','Terms Filter'=>'术语过滤器','Post Types Filter'=>'帖子类型过滤器','All Post Types'=>'所有Post Types','No posts found.'=>'未找到帖子。','Terms for Current Post (PublishPress Taxonomies)'=>'当前文章的术语（PublishPress Taxonomies）','PublishPress Taxonomies Terms for Current Post Shortcode'=>'当前文章短代码的 PublishPress Taxonomies 术语','Terms for Current Post are added on '=>'当前文章的术语添加于 ','Select widget terms for current post.'=>'选择当前文章的 widget 术语。','No terms for current post shortcode available. Add new shortcode '=>'当前文章短代码没有可用的术语。添加新的短代码 ','Search Posts'=>'搜索文章','Related Posts successfully deleted.'=>'相关帖子成功删除。','Related Posts not found.'=>'未找到相关帖子。','Related Post'=>'相关帖子','Current post type'=>'当前帖子类型','PublishPress Taxonomies Related Posts Shortcode'=>'PublishPress 分类法相关帖子 Shortcode','Related Posts are added on '=>'相关帖子已添加于 ','Select widget Related Posts.'=>'选择小部件相关帖子。','No Related Posts shortcode available. Add new shortcode '=>'没有可用的相关帖子 shortcode。添加新的 shortcode ','Add New Related Post'=>'添加新相关文章','The Related Posts feature works by checking for shared taxonomy terms. If your post has the terms “WordPress” and “Website”, then Related Posts will display other posts that also have the terms “WordPress” and “Website”.'=>'相关文章功能通过检查共享的分类法术语来工作。如果您的帖子具有“WordPress”和“网站”这两个术语，那么相关文章将显示其他也具有“WordPress”和“网站”这两个术语的帖子。','Search Related Posts'=>'搜索相关文章','Manage Related Posts'=>'管理相关文章','Preview Related Posts'=>'预览相关文章','Edit Related Posts'=>'编辑相关文章','Add new Related Posts'=>'添加新的相关文章','To create more Related Posts, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'要创建更多相关文章，请升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Related Posts. You can create Related Posts for any taxonomy and then display those Related Posts anywhere on your site.'=>'使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以创建无限数量的相关文章。您可以为任何分类法创建相关文章，然后在您网站的任何地方显示这些相关文章。','Display format'=>'显示格式','Hide title in output ?'=>'在输出中隐藏标题？','Title header'=>'标题头','Maximum related posts to display'=>'最大相关文章数以显示','Specify the number of related posts to display.'=>'指定要显示的相关文章数量。','Attempt to automatically display related posts'=>'尝试自动显示相关文章','PublishPress Taxonomies will attempt to automatically display related posts in this content. It may not be successful for all post types and layouts.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 将尝试在此内容中自动显示相关文章。对于所有文章类型和布局，它可能无法成功。','Box List'=>'框列表','Unordered List (UL/LI)'=>'无序列表 (UL/LI)','Ordered List (OL/LI)'=>'有序列表 (OL/LI)','This setting allows you to customize the appearance of Related Post links. You can use any of the tokens shown below or find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'此设置允许您自定义相关文章链接的外观。您可以使用下面显示的任何令牌，或在文档中找到更多详细信息 %1$s%2$s。','Related Posts format'=>'相关文章格式','Here are the tokens you can use for related posts format'=>'以下是您可以用于相关文章格式的标记','The URL of the post'=>'文章的 URL','The title of the post'=>'文章的标题','The date of the post (this shows inside a tooltip)'=>'文章的日期（此内容将在工具提示中显示）','The number of tags used by both posts'=>'两篇文章使用的标签数量','The number of comments on the post'=>'文章的评论数量','The ID of the post'=>'文章的 ID','A list of tags used by both the current post and the related post'=>'当前文章和相关文章使用的标签列表','The post excerpt'=>'文章摘要','The post featured image URL'=>'文章特色图像 URL','The post content'=>'文章内容','The post category'=>'文章类别','The font size of the post'=>'文章的字体大小','The color of the post title'=>'帖子标题的颜色','PublishPress Taxonomies will display related posts from selected post types.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 将显示来自选定文章类型的相关文章。','Text to display before posts list'=>'在文章列表之前显示的文本','Enter the text that should be displayed before the posts list.'=>'输入应在文章列表之前显示的文本。','Text to display after posts list'=>'在文章列表之后显示的文本','Enter the text that should be display after the posts list.'=>'输入应在文章列表之后显示的文本。','Limit related posts based on timeframe'=>'根据时间范围限制相关帖子','Least common tags between posts'=>'帖子之间最少的公共标签','Most common tags between posts'=>'帖子之间最多的公共标签','Older Entries'=>'旧条目','Newer Entries'=>'新条目','Alphabetical'=>'字母顺序','Inverse Alphabetical'=>'逆字母顺序','Related Posts Order'=>'相关帖子顺序','Text to show when there is no related post'=>'没有相关帖子时显示的文本','Hide output if no related post is found ?'=>'如果未找到相关帖子，是否隐藏输出？','Related Posts div class'=>'相关帖子 div 类','d.m.Y (e.g., 09.10.2024)'=>'d.m.Y（例如，09.10.2024）','F j, Y (e.g., October 9, 2024)'=>'F j, Y（例如，2024年10月9日）','Y-m-d (e.g., 2024-10-09)'=>'Y-m-d（例如，2024-10-09）','m/d/Y (e.g., 10/09/2024)'=>'m/d/Y（例如，10/09/2024）','d M, Y (e.g., 09 Oct, 2024)'=>'d M, Y（例如，09 Oct, 2024）','Post date format'=>'帖子日期格式','Maximum characters of post content to display'=>'显示的帖子内容最大字符数','Maximum number of categories'=>'最大分类数','You must set zero (0) to display all post categories.'=>'您必须设置为零（0）以显示所有帖子分类。','Maximum number of tags'=>'最大标签数','Thumbnail (150x150)'=>'缩略图（150x150）','Medium (300x300)'=>'中等（300x300）','Large (1024x1024)'=>'大（1024x1024）','1536x1536 (High Res)'=>'1536x1536（高分辨率）','2048x2048 (Ultra High Res)'=>'2048x2048（超高分辨率）','Thumbnail image resolution'=>'缩略图图像分辨率','Default post thumbnail'=>'默认帖子缩略图','Use Default Image'=>'使用默认图像','Remove Image'=>'移除图像','Select the default %post_thumb_url% to be used when a post doesn\'t have a featured image.'=>'选择默认的 %post_thumb_url% 当文章没有特色图片时使用。','Save Related Posts'=>'保存相关文章','Add Related Posts'=>'添加相关文章','No related posts found.'=>'未找到相关帖子。','autotermsschedulelog'=>'autotermsschedulelog','autotermsschedulelogs'=>'autotermsschedulelogs','Select all scheduled auto terms logs'=>'选择所有计划的自动术语日志','Schedule log is empty.'=>'计划日志为空。','Select scheduled auto terms log %s'=>'选择计划的自动术语日志 %s','Auto Terms Schedule'=>'自动条款计划','Schedule is disabled. Please enable a schedule frequency to run a test.'=>'计划已禁用。请启用计划频率以运行测试。','Scheduled the cron event %s to run now. The original event will not be affected.'=>'已安排 cron 事件 %s 立即运行。原始事件将不会受到影响。','Schedule is not enabled for selected Auto Terms.'=>'所选的自动术语未启用计划。','This feature allows you to run the Auto Terms feature on a schedule. This is helpful if you regularly import content into WordPress. PublishPress Taxonomies can run on a schedule and add terms to your imported content.'=>'此功能允许您按计划运行自动术语功能。如果您定期将内容导入到WordPress，这将非常有用。PublishPress Taxonomies可以按计划运行并将术语添加到您导入的内容中。','Select Auto Terms settings to use when running the "Schedule" feature.'=>'选择运行“计划”功能时要使用的自动术语设置。','Do not run on a schedule'=>'不按计划运行','Weekly'=>'每周','Schedule Frequency'=>'计划频率','Disable \'Do not run on a schedule\' to select schedule frequency.'=>'禁用“不要按计划运行”以选择计划频率。','This enables you to skip posts that have already been analyzed by the Schedule feature.'=>'这使您能够跳过已被计划功能分析的帖子。','This enables your scheduled Auto Terms to run in batches. If you have a lot of content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'这使您的计划自动术语以批次运行。如果您有很多内容，请将此设置为较低的数字以避免超时。','This setting can limit your scheduled Auto Terms query to only recent content. We recommend using this feature to avoid timeouts on large sites.'=>'此设置可以将您的计划自动条款查询限制为仅最近的内容。我们建议使用此功能以避免在大型网站上出现超时。','Test Run'=>'测试运行','Recent Schedule Runs'=>'最近的计划运行','Terms Display successfully deleted.'=>'条款显示已成功删除。','Cloud'=>'云','WordPress Default'=>'WordPress 默认','Table List'=>'表格列表','Border Cloud'=>'边框云','Parent / Child'=>'父 / 子','Add New Terms Display'=>'添加新术语显示','Search Terms Display'=>'搜索术语显示','Manage Terms Display'=>'管理术语显示','Preview Terms Display'=>'预览术语显示','Move up'=>'上移','Move down'=>'下移','Edit Terms Display'=>'编辑术语显示','Add new Terms Display'=>'添加新术语显示','To create more Terms Display, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'要创建更多术语显示，请升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms Display. You can create Terms Display for any taxonomy and then display those Terms Display anywhere on your site.'=>'使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以创建无限的术语显示。您可以为任何分类法创建术语显示，然后在您网站的任何地方展示这些术语显示。','Hide title in output?'=>'输出中隐藏标题？','All post types'=>'所有文章类型','All Parent Terms'=>'所有父术语','Parent Term'=>'父术语','Display only Parent Terms'=>'仅显示父术语','Display only Sub-Terms'=>'仅显示子术语','Display Parents and Sub-Terms'=>'显示父项和子项','Display Mode'=>'显示模式','Term selection mode'=>'术语选择模式','Automatic'=>'自动','Display terms based on settings in the "General" tab.'=>'根据“常规”选项卡中的设置显示术语。','Custom'=>'自定义','Display only the specific terms entered in the "Custom terms to display" field below.'=>'仅显示在下面“要显示的自定义术语”字段中输入的特定术语。','Combined'=>'组合','Display automatic terms plus any additional custom terms specified below.'=>'显示自动术语以及下面指定的任何附加自定义术语。','Custom terms to display'=>'要显示的自定义术语','Enter terms (comma-separated) to display. Used in Custom and Combined modes.'=>'输入要显示的术语（以逗号分隔）。在自定义和组合模式中使用。','Minimum term usage'=>'最低术语使用量','Only display terms used by at least this many content items. Set to 0 for no minimum.'=>'仅显示至少由这么多内容项使用的术语。设置为 0 表示没有最低限制。','Exclude terms from terms display'=>'从术语显示中排除术语','Enter terms (comma-separated) to exclude from the terms display.'=>'输入要从术语显示中排除的术语（用逗号分隔）。','Exclude hidden terms from Terms Display?'=>'从术语显示中排除隐藏的术语？','Hide display output if no terms?'=>'如果没有术语，是否隐藏显示输出？','This is the color of the least popular term'=>'这是最不受欢迎术语的颜色','This is the color of the most popular term'=>'这是最受欢迎术语的颜色','Term display div class'=>'术语显示 div 类','This option allows you to change the format of your terms. You can use any of the tokens shown below. Find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'此选项允许您更改术语的格式。您可以使用下面显示的任何令牌。查看文档中的更多详细信息 %1$s%2$s。','Terms Display format'=>'术语显示格式','Here are the tokens you can use for Term link format'=>'以下是您可以用于术语链接格式的令牌','The URL of the term'=>'术语的 URL','The ID of the term'=>'术语的 ID','The weighted size of the term in the display'=>'术语在显示中的加权大小','The number of times the term is used'=>'术语使用的次数','The font size for the term'=>'术语的字体大小','The font color for the term'=>'术语的字体颜色','The name of the term'=>'术语的名称','The name of the term with any HTML stripped out'=>'去除任何 HTML 的术语名称','The description of the term'=>'术语的描述','Font size minimum must not be greater than Font size maximum value.'=>'字体大小的最小值不得大于字体大小的最大值。','Save Terms Display'=>'保存术语显示','Add Terms Display'=>'添加术语显示','Invalid nonce'=>'无效的 nonce','Missing display ID.'=>'缺少显示 ID。','Invalid terms display configuration.'=>'无效的术语显示配置。','There are no terms in this taxonomy.'=>'此 taxonomy 中没有术语。','Please provide a taxonomy to delete'=>'请提供要删除的 taxonomy','Please provide a taxonomy name'=>'请提供一个 taxonomy 名称','Object'=>'对象','%s has been successfully added'=>'%s 已成功添加','%s has failed to be added'=>'%s 添加失败','%s has been successfully updated'=>'%s 已成功更新','%s has failed to be updated'=>'%s 更新失败','%s has been successfully deleted'=>'%s 已成功删除','%s has failed to be deleted'=>'%s 删除失败','Nonce failed verification'=>'Nonce 验证失败','Please choose a different taxonomy name. %s is already registered.'=>'请选择一个不同的 taxonomy 名称。%s 已被注册。','Please provide a post type to attach to.'=>'请提供一个要附加的 post type。','Please choose a different post type name. %s matches an existing page slug, which can cause conflicts.'=>'请选择一个不同的 post type 名称。%s 与现有页面的 slug 匹配，这可能会导致冲突。','Please do not use quotes in post type/taxonomy names or rewrite slugs'=>'请勿在 post type/taxonomy 名称或重写 slug 中使用引号','%s has been successfully imported'=>'%s 已成功导入','%s has failed to be imported'=>'%s 导入失败','Add new %s'=>'添加新的 %s','Edit %s'=>'编辑 %s','New %s'=>'新 %s','View %s'=>'查看 %s','Search %s'=>'搜索 %s','No %s found.'=>'未找到 %s。','No %s found in trash.'=>'在垃圾箱中未找到 %s。','Popular %s'=>'热门 %s','Parent %s'=>'父级 %s','Parent %s:'=>'父级 %s：','Update %s'=>'更新 %s','New %s name'=>'新的 %s 名称','Separate %s with commas'=>'用逗号分隔 %s','Add or remove %s'=>'添加或移除 %s','Choose from the most used %s'=>'从最常用的 %s 中选择','Kindly select an action in bulk action dropdown!'=>'请在批量操作下拉菜单中选择一个操作！','Kindly select atleast one taxonomy to proceed'=>'请至少选择一个taxonomy以继续','Taxonomy has been successfully deactivated'=>'Taxonomy已成功停用','Taxonomy has been successfully activated'=>'Taxonomy已成功启用','Taxonomy has been successfully deleted'=>'Taxonomy已成功删除','Are you sure you want to delete this? Deleting will NOT remove created content.'=>'您确定要删除此项吗？删除不会移除已创建的内容。','Please select at least one post type.'=>'请至少选择一个post type。','Taxonomy slug cannot be numbers only.'=>'Taxonomy slug不能仅由数字组成。','Add New'=>'添加新项','Search Taxonomies'=>'搜索Taxonomies','All Taxonomies'=>'所有Taxonomies','Invalid nonce. Request is not authorized.'=>'无效的nonce。请求未被授权。','You do not have permission to view terms in this taxonomy.'=>'您没有权限查看此taxonomy中的术语。','Unable to retrieve terms for this taxonomy.'=>'无法检索此taxonomy的术语。','Manage Taxonomy'=>'管理 Taxonomy','Edit Taxonomy'=>'编辑 Taxonomy','Add new Taxonomy'=>'添加新的 Taxonomy','Permalinks'=>'Permalinks','Admin Area'=>'Admin Area','Other Labels'=>'其他标签','REST API'=>'REST API','Deactivate or Delete'=>'停用或删除','Taxonomy Slug'=>'Taxonomy Slug','Slug has changed'=>'Slug 已更改','Slug already exists'=>'Slug 已经存在','Special character not allowed in slug.'=>'Slug 中不允许使用特殊字符。','The “slug” is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'“slug” 是名称的 URL 友好版本。它通常全部为小写，仅包含字母、数字和下划线。','DO NOT EDIT the taxonomy slug unless also planning to migrate terms. Changing the slug registers a new taxonomy entry.'=>'除非也计划迁移术语，否则请勿编辑 taxonomy slug。更改 slug 会注册新的 taxonomy 条目。','Migrate terms to newly renamed taxonomy?'=>'将术语迁移到新命名的 taxonomy 吗？','(e.g. Jobs)'=>'(例如：Jobs)','Plural Label'=>'复数标签','(e.g. Job)'=>'(例如：Job)','Singular Label'=>'单数标签','Parent-Child Relationships'=>'父子关系','Can terms in this taxonomy be organized into hierarchical relationships?'=>'此分类法中的术语可以组织成层次关系吗？','Describe what your taxonomy is used for.'=>'描述您的分类法的用途。','Default Terms'=>'默认术语','Set the default terms for this taxonomy. These will be automatically added to all new posts. Enter the term names or slugs. Separate multiple terms with by comma.'=>'为此分类法设置默认术语。这些术语将自动添加到所有新帖子中。输入术语名称或别名。用逗号分隔多个术语。','Archive page result'=>'存档页面结果','Normally, WordPress will only show one post type on taxonomy archive pages. Enable this feature to show content from all selected posts types.'=>'通常，WordPress 只会在分类法存档页面上显示一种帖子类型。启用此功能以显示所有选定的帖子类型的内容。','Rewrite'=>'重写','WordPress can use a custom permalink for this taxonomy. It does not have to match the slug.'=>'WordPress 可以为此分类法使用自定义永久链接。它不必与别名匹配。','(default: taxonomy name)'=>'(默认：分类法名称)','Custom Rewrite Slug'=>'自定义重写别名','Custom taxonomy rewrite slug.'=>'自定义分类法重写别名。','Rewrite With Front'=>'带前缀的重写','Should the permastruct be prepended with the front base.'=>'永久结构是否应以前缀基础开头。','Rewrite Hierarchical'=>'重写层次结构','Should the permastruct allow hierarchical urls.'=>'永久结构是否允许层次 URL。','Show user interface'=>'显示用户界面','Should there be a visible interface in the WordPress admin area to manage these terms?'=>'在 WordPress 管理区域中是否应该有一个可见的界面来管理这些术语？','Show in admin menus'=>'在管理菜单中显示','Should there be links to this taxonomy in the WordPress admin menus?'=>'在WordPress管理菜单中是否应该有指向此taxonomy的链接？','Show in frontend menus'=>'在前端菜单中显示','Should this taxonomy be available for the frontend “Menus” and “Navigation” options?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在前端的“菜单”和“导航”选项中可用？','Show admin column'=>'显示管理列','Should a column for this taxonomy appear on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy的列是否应该出现在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕上？','Show in "Quick Edit" and "Bulk Edit"'=>'在“快速编辑”和“批量编辑”中显示','Should this taxonomy be available in editing tools on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕的编辑工具中可用？','Show in Filter'=>'在筛选器中显示','Should this taxonomy be available in filters on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕的筛选器中可用？','Menu Name'=>'菜单名称','Custom admin menu name for your taxonomy.'=>'您taxonomy的自定义管理菜单名称。','(e.g. All Jobs)'=>'(例如：所有作业)','All Items'=>'所有项目','Used as tab text when showing all terms for hierarchical taxonomy while editing post.'=>'在编辑文章时用于显示层次taxonomy的所有条目的标签文本。','(e.g. Edit Job)'=>'(例如：编辑作业)','Edit Item'=>'编辑项目','Used at the top of the term editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'用于现有taxonomy条目的术语编辑器屏幕顶部。','(e.g. View Job)'=>'(例如：查看作业)','View Item'=>'查看项目','Used in the admin bar when viewing editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'在查看现有 taxonomy 术语的编辑器屏幕时使用的管理栏。','(e.g. Update Job Name)'=>'(例如：更新工作名称)','Update Item Name'=>'更新项目名称','Custom taxonomy label. Used in the admin menu for displaying taxonomies.'=>'自定义 taxonomy 标签。在管理菜单中用于显示 taxonomies。','Update %s name'=>'更新 %s 名称','(e.g. Add New Job)'=>'(例如：添加新工作)','Add New Item'=>'添加新项目','Used at the top of the term editor screen and button text for a new taxonomy term.'=>'用于术语编辑器屏幕顶部和新 taxonomy 术语的按钮文本。','(e.g. New Job Name)'=>'(例如：新工作名称)','New Item Name'=>'新项目名称','(e.g. Parent Job)'=>'(例如：父工作)','Parent Item'=>'父项目','(e.g. Parent Job:)'=>'(例如：父工作：)','Parent Item Colon'=>'父项目冒号','(e.g. Search Jobs)'=>'(例如：搜索工作)','Search Items'=>'搜索项目','(e.g. Popular Jobs)'=>'(例如：热门工作)','Popular Items'=>'热门项目','(e.g. Separate Jobs with commas)'=>'(例如：用逗号分隔工作)','Separate Items with Commas'=>'用逗号分隔项目','(e.g. Add or remove Jobs)'=>'(例如，添加或移除工作)','Add or Remove Items'=>'添加或移除项目','(e.g. Choose from the most used Jobs)'=>'(例如，从最常用的工作中选择)','Choose From Most Used'=>'从最常用的中选择','(e.g. No jobs)'=>'(例如，没有工作)','No terms'=>'没有术语','Used when indicating that there are no terms in the given taxonomy associated with an object.'=>'用于指示在给定的分类法中与对象关联的术语不存在。','No %s'=>'没有 %s','(e.g. Jobs list navigation)'=>'(例如，工作列表导航)','Items List Navigation'=>'项目列表导航','Screen reader text for the pagination heading on the term listing screen.'=>'在术语列表屏幕上的分页标题的屏幕阅读器文本。','%s list navigation'=>'%s 列表导航','(e.g. Jobs list)'=>'(例如，工作列表)','Items List'=>'项目列表','Screen reader text for the items list heading on the term listing screen.'=>'在术语列表屏幕上的项目列表标题的屏幕阅读器文本。','%s list'=>'%s 列表','(e.g. No jobs found)'=>'(例如，未找到工作)','Not Found'=>'未找到','The text displayed via clicking ‘Choose from the most used items’ in the taxonomy meta box when no items are available.'=>'在分类法元框中点击“从最常用的项目中选择”时显示的文本，当没有可用项目时。','No %s found'=>'没有找到 %s','(e.g. &larr; Back to jobs'=>'(例如 &larr; 返回到职位','Back to Items'=>'返回到项目','The text displayed after a term has been updated for a link back to main index.'=>'更新后显示的文本，用于链接回主索引。','Back to %s'=>'返回到 %s','Show in REST API'=>'在 REST API 中显示','Add the taxonomy to the WordPress wp-json API.'=>'将分类法添加到 WordPress wp-json API。','REST API base slug'=>'REST API 基础 slug','The base slug that this taxonomy will use in the REST API.'=>'此分类法在 REST API 中使用的基础 slug。','REST API controller class'=>'REST API 控制器类','The name of a custom Rest Controller class instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'自定义 Rest 控制器类的名称，而不是 WP_REST_Terms_Controller。','Custom controller to use instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'自定义控制器，用于替代 WP_REST_Terms_Controller。','Public'=>'公开','The taxonomy is for public use. It can be seen by frontend users.'=>'该分类法供公共使用。前端用户可以看到。','Public Queryable'=>'公开可查询','The taxonomy is publicly queryable.'=>'该分类法可以公开查询。','Query Var'=>'查询变量','Enable a custom query_var key for this taxonomy.'=>'为此分类法启用自定义 query_var 键。','Custom Query Var String'=>'自定义查询变量字符串','Sets a custom query_var slug for this taxonomy.'=>'为此分类法设置自定义 query_var slug。','Metabox callback'=>'Metabox 回调','Sets a callback function name for the meta box display. Hierarchical default: post_categories_meta_box, non-hierarchical default: post_tags_meta_box. To remove the metabox completely, use "false".'=>'设置一个回调函数名称用于元框显示。层次结构默认值：post_categories_meta_box，非层次结构默认值：post_tags_meta_box。要完全移除元框，请使用 "false"。','Categories'=>'Categories','This feature controls the order of %s when you\'re editing posts, and in frontend displays.'=>'此功能控制您在编辑帖子时 %s 的顺序，以及在前端显示时的顺序。','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'启用 PublishPress taxonomy 排序','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering for this taxonomy in the frontend and admin area.'=>'在前端和管理区域启用此 taxonomy 的 PublishPress taxonomy 排序。','Re-activate Taxonomy'=>'重新激活 taxonomy','Deactivate Taxonomy'=>'停用 taxonomy','Delete Taxonomy'=>'删除 taxonomy','Delete PublishPress Taxonomies Edit Data'=>'删除 PublishPress taxonomy 编辑数据','You can only delete taxonomies created with PublishPress Taxonomies. However, you can delete any changes or edit made from PublishPress Taxonomies which will remove PublishPress Taxonomies version edit restoring original taxonomies data or removing it if already deleted'=>'您只能删除使用 PublishPress taxonomy 创建的 taxonomy。不过，您可以删除从 PublishPress taxonomy 所做的任何更改或编辑，这将删除 PublishPress taxonomy 版本编辑，恢复原始 taxonomy 数据或移除已删除的内容。','Save Taxonomy'=>'保存 taxonomy','Add Taxonomy'=>'添加 taxonomy','Term copied successfully.'=>'术语复制成功。','Term deleted successfully.'=>'术语删除成功。','Term removed from all posts successfully.'=>'术语成功从所有帖子中移除。','Synonyms'=>'同义词','Status'=>'状态','Copy'=>'复制','Select Destination Taxonomy'=>'选择目标 taxonomy','Search posts'=>'搜索帖子','post type'=>'post type','Select Destination %s'=>'选择目标 %s','Terms deleted successfully.'=>'条目已成功删除。','Term(s) copied successfully.'=>'条目已成功复制。','Hidden'=>'隐藏','Live'=>'公开','No terms found.'=>'未找到条目。','Quick edit &#8220;%s&#8221; inline'=>'快速编辑 &#8220;%s&#8221; 内联','Quick&nbsp;Edit'=>'快速&nbsp;编辑','Remove From All Posts'=>'从所有帖子中移除','Quick Edit'=>'快速编辑','This screen allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'此屏幕允许您搜索和编辑您网站上的所有条目。','This screen allows you to order terms via drag and drop.'=>'此屏幕允许您通过拖放来排序术语。','Search Terms'=>'搜索术语','Media Tags'=>'媒体标签','Media Tag'=>'媒体标签','All Media Tags'=>'所有媒体标签','Edit Media Tag'=>'编辑媒体标签','View Media Tag'=>'查看媒体标签','Update Media Tag name'=>'更新媒体标签名称','Add new Media Tag'=>'添加新的媒体标签','New Media Tag name'=>'新媒体标签名称','Parent Media Tag'=>'父媒体标签','Parent Media Tag:'=>'父媒体标签：','Search Media Tags'=>'搜索媒体标签','Popular Media Tags'=>'热门媒体标签','Separate Media Tags with commas'=>'用逗号分隔媒体标签','Add or remove Media Tags'=>'添加或删除媒体标签','Choose from the most used Media Tags'=>'从最常用的媒体标签中选择','No Media Tags found'=>'未找到媒体标签','No Media Tags'=>'没有媒体标签','Media Tags list navigation'=>'媒体标签列表导航','Media Tags list'=>'媒体标签列表','Back to Media Tags'=>'返回媒体标签','PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Search PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'搜索 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Edit PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'编辑 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Update PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'更新 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Add New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'添加新的 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'新的 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free. The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'您正在使用 PublishPress Taxonomies 免费版。专业版具有更多功能和支持。','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','Enhance the power of PublishPress Taxonomies with the Pro version:'=>'通过专业版增强 PublishPress Taxonomies 的功能：','Unlimited “Term Display”'=>'无限制的“术语显示”','Unlimited “Terms for Current Posts”'=>'无限制的“当前帖子术语”','Unlimited “Related Posts”'=>'无限制的“相关帖子”','Unlimited “Auto Links”'=>'无限制的“自动链接”','Unlimited “Auto Terms”'=>'无限制的“自动术语”','Create new terms using OpenAI and other sources'=>'使用 OpenAI 和其他来源创建新术语','Use Linked Terms'=>'使用关联术语','Use Synonyms'=>'使用同义词','Schedule Auto Terms to run automatically'=>'安排自动术语自动运行','Control the display of term metaboxes'=>'控制术语元框的显示','Fast, professional support'=>'快速、专业的支持','No ads inside the plugin'=>'插件内部无广告','Need PublishPress Taxonomies Support?'=>'需要 PublishPress Taxonomies 支持吗？','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要帮助或有新的功能请求，请告诉我们。','Request Support'=>'请求支持','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'详细文档也可以在插件网站上找到。','View Knowledge Base'=>'查看知识库','OpenAI Integration'=>'OpenAI 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate OpenAI to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 OpenAI 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','IBM Watson Integration'=>'IBM Watson 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Watson to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 Watson 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','Dandelion Integration'=>'蒲公英集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Dandelion to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成蒲公英来分析您的内容并建议术语。','LSEG / Refinitiv Integration'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate LSEG / Refinitiv to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 LSEG / Refinitiv 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','Suggest terms using AI'=>'使用 AI 建议术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您使用 OpenAI 为您的内容建议新术语。此服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the IBM Watson. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您使用 IBM Watson 为您的内容建议新术语。此服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','Copy with Metadata'=>'复制带元数据','Auto Terms using AI Connectors'=>'使用 AI 连接器的自动术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro can generate terms using any compatible AI provider configured in Settings > Connectors.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 可以使用在设置 > 连接器中配置的任何兼容 AI 提供者生成术语。','Auto terms using AI'=>'使用AI自动生成术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and add new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您使用OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion和Open Calais服务为您的内容生成新术语。这些服务可以分析您的内容并添加新术语。','Additional taxonomies'=>'附加分类法','Select additional taxonomies...'=>'选择附加分类法...','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，以在一次 OpenAI 请求中为多个分类法生成单独的术语。','Generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'在一次 OpenAI 请求中为多个分类法生成单独的术语。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您使用OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion和Open Calais服务为您的内容建议新术语。这些服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','Add Custom Elements'=>'添加自定义元素','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您完全控制自动链接添加的位置。您可以选择跳过出现在您内容中的任何HTML元素。','Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms'=>'使用正则表达式修改自动术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use this feature.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您更改自动术语分析您帖子的方法。您需要知道如何编写正则表达式才能使用此功能。','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also.'=>'此功能允许您连接术语。当主术语或这些术语中的任何一个被添加到帖子时，所有其他术语也将被添加。','Linked Terms Feature'=>'链接术语功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization across your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您在术语之间创建强大的连接。当一个术语被添加到帖子时，其链接术语也可以自动添加。这有助于在您的内容中保持一致的组织。','This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For example, "website" can have synonyms such as "websites", "web site", and "web pages".'=>'此功能允许您将额外的词与每个术语关联。例如，“网站”可以具有“网站”、“网页”和“网页”的同义词。','Synonyms Terms Feature'=>'同义词术语功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您有多个词与单个术语关联。如果PublishPress Taxonomies扫描您的内容并找到一个同义词，它将表现得像找到了主术语。','Taxonomy Display'=>'分类显示','This feature is available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'此功能在PublishPress Taxonomies Pro中可用','Customize the display of terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'自定义PublishPress Taxonomies元框中术语的显示。','Options include checkboxes and a dropdown list.'=>'选项包括复选框和下拉列表。','Copy Term with Metadata'=>'复制带有元数据的术语','To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro.'=>'要复制带有元数据的术语，请升级到专业版。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent organization across your site.'=>'使用PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以复制分类术语及其所有元数据。这包括术语描述、图像和自定义字段。您可以在分类之间复制术语，以在您的网站上保持一致的组织。','Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, ordered list, border-cloud and lots more.'=>'选择您的术语的显示格式，选项包括表格列表、有序列表、边框云等。','Hourly'=>'每小时','Daily'=>'每日','Pro Feature'=>'专业功能','Some of these features are available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'这些功能中的一些在 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 中可用','ID'=>'ID','Name (Pro)'=>'名称 (专业)','Counter (Pro)'=>'计数器 (专业)','Random (Pro)'=>'随机 (专业)','Term Order (Pro)'=>'术语顺序 (专业)','Order terms for display by'=>'按以下方式排序术语以供显示','Term Order'=>'术语顺序','Disabled'=>'已禁用','You have disabled PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'您已禁用 PublishPress Taxonomies 的排序','Terms in this taxonomy are ordered by %s'=>'此分类法中的术语按 %s 排序','Term Order(Pro)'=>'术语顺序 (专业)','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to use Term Order to manually order Terms'=>'升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 以使用术语顺序手动排序术语','The provider request was not sent.'=>'提供者请求未发送。','Result from api.'=>'来自 API 的结果。','Request completed.'=>'请求已完成。','Security error. Kindly reload this page and try again'=>'安全错误。请重新加载此页面并重试','Permission error. You do not have permission to manage PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'权限错误。您没有权限管理 PublishPress Taxonomies','Posts content and title is empty.'=>'帖子内容和标题为空。','Permission error. You do not have permission to preview this post.'=>'权限错误。您没有权限预览此帖子。','You do not have permission to manage this taxonomy. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'您没有权限管理此 taxonomy。在 %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s 中为此角色启用 Metabox Access Taxonomies。','Too many AI preview requests. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'请求的 AI 预览次数过多。请稍等一会儿再试。','Term Results'=>'术语结果','No results found for this post with this taxonomy.'=>'未找到与此 taxonomy 关联的该帖子的结果。','Invalid Auto Term ID. Please save the settings before using preview.'=>'无效的自动术语 ID。请在使用预览之前保存设置。','You must enable at least one AI integration source to use auto term preview.'=>'您必须启用至少一个 AI 集成源才能使用自动术语预览。','This Auto Terms option is not enabled for metaboxes. Please enable it in the Auto Terms settings.'=>'此自动术语选项未为 metaboxes 启用。请在自动术语设置中启用它。','Click %1s to select or deselect them from this %2s.'=>'点击 %1s 从该 %2s 中选择或取消选择它们。','Suggest Existing Terms'=>'建议现有术语','AI Connectors: %s'=>'AI 连接器：%s','Update %1s on this %2s'=>'在此 %2s 上更新 %1s','Existing Terms not found for the selected post type and taxonomies'=>'未找到与所选帖子类型和 taxonomies 相关的现有术语','Existing Terms taxonomy is required. Kindly select taxonomies and save the settings before running preview.'=>'需要现有术语 taxonomy。请在运行预览之前选择 taxonomies 并保存设置。','Result from ajax request.'=>'来自 ajax 请求的结果。','The selected taxonomy is not associated with the selected post type.'=>'所选的 taxonomy 与所选的 post type 不相关联。','No results found for this taxonomy.'=>'未找到该 taxonomy 的结果。','You do not have permission to edit this post.'=>'您没有权限编辑此帖子。','You do not have permission to assign terms from this taxonomy.'=>'您没有权限从此 taxonomy 分配术语。','Click Term to select or deselect from this %1s'=>'单击术语以从此 %1s 中选择或取消选择','Both Taxonomy and Post are required.'=>'taxonomy 和 post 都是必需的。','No new terms were selected or deselected.'=>'没有选择或取消选择新术语。','%1s terms added to this %2s.'=>'%1s 术语已添加到此 %2s。','%1s terms removed from this %2s.'=>'%1s 术语已从此 %2s 中移除。','You do not have capability to manage this taxonomy.'=>'您没有管理此 taxonomy 的能力。','You do not have permission to edit this post with this taxonomy.'=>'您没有权限使用此 taxonomy 编辑此帖子。','Terms cannot contain the following characters: %s'=>'术语不能包含以下字符：%s','Terms must be at least %d characters long.'=>'术语必须至少 %d 个字符长。','Terms cannot exceed %d characters.'=>'术语不能超过 %d 个字符。','The Dandelion integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Dandelion 集成在 Legacy AI Sources 设置中已禁用。','No matched result from the API Server.'=>'API 服务器没有匹配的结果。','The Dandelion integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Dandelion 集成需要一个 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','Selected content is empty.'=>'所选内容为空。','Result from cache.'=>'来自缓存的结果。','API Error: %1s.'=>'API 错误：%1$s。','Empty response.'=>'空响应。','Error establishing connection with the API server. Try again.'=>'与 API 服务器建立连接时出错。请重试。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成在遗留 AI 源设置中已禁用。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成需要 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','API Error: No matched result for content.'=>'API 错误：没有匹配的内容结果。','The IBM Watson integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'IBM Watson 集成在遗留 AI 源设置中已禁用。','The IBM Watson integration requires an API Key and URL. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'IBM Watson 集成需要 API 密钥和 URL。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','The IBM Watson API URL must use HTTPS and an official Natural Language Understanding service hostname.'=>'IBM Watson API URL 必须使用 HTTPS 和官方自然语言理解服务主机名。','No matched result from an AI Connector.'=>'来自 AI 连接器的结果未匹配。','AI Connectors require WordPress 7.0 or newer.'=>'AI 连接器需要 WordPress 7.0 或更高版本。','Invalid placeholder(s) detected: {%s}. Valid placeholders are: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}'=>'检测到无效的占位符：{%s}。有效的占位符有：{content}，{post_terms}，{site_terms}','You added {post_terms} in the prompt but your post does not contain any terms.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {post_terms}，但您的帖子不包含任何术语。','You added {site_terms} in the prompt but your site does not contain any terms for this taxonomy.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {site_terms}，但您的站点不包含此分类法的任何术语。','The selected AI Connector is not configured. Choose a connected provider in Auto Terms > Sources.'=>'所选的 AI 连接器未配置。在自动术语 > 源中选择一个已连接的提供者。','AI is disabled or unavailable on this site. Check the WordPress AI settings before generating terms.'=>'此站点上的 AI 已禁用或不可用。在生成术语之前，请检查 WordPress AI 设置。','The selected AI Connector cannot generate text for this request. Check its connection and text generation support in Settings > Connectors.'=>'所选的 AI 连接器无法为此请求生成文本。请检查其连接和文本生成支持，路径为设置 > 连接器。','Result from an AI Connector.'=>'来自 AI 连接器的结果。','The direct OpenAI integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'在旧版 AI 源设置中禁用了直接的 OpenAI 集成。','The OpenAI integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'OpenAI 集成需要 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','Error: OpenAI says there is an issue with this API key. Please check your plan or billing details.'=>'错误：OpenAI 表示此 API 密钥存在问题。请检查您的计划或账单详细信息。','View Existing Terms'=>'查看现有术语','This feature allows you to browse all the terms in a taxonomy.'=>'此功能允许您浏览分类法中的所有术语。','View Current Post Terms'=>'查看当前帖子术语','This feature allows you to manage all the terms that are currently attached to a post.'=>'此功能允许您管理当前附加到帖子的所有术语。','View Terms'=>'查看术语','This feature allows you to browse based on selected auto terms settings and sources.'=>'此功能允许您根据所选的自动术语设置和来源进行浏览。','Suggest Terms'=>'建议术语','Select all %1s'=>'选择所有 %1s','Deselect all %1s'=>'取消选择所有 %1s','Select %1s'=>'选择 %1s','Please choose a post to use with PublishPress Taxonomies AI.'=>'请选择一个帖子以与 PublishPress Taxonomies AI 一起使用。','Label can\'t be empty.'=>'标签不能为空。','Label can\'t exceed 30 characters.'=>'标签不能超过 30 个字符。','Unknown tab type.'=>'未知的选项卡类型。','Error saving label.'=>'保存标签时出错。','Please choose a post to preview.'=>'请选择一个帖子进行预览。','Metabox Settings'=>'元框设置','This feature allows you to customize the metabox interface you see when adding terms to posts.'=>'此功能允许您自定义在将术语添加到帖子时看到的元框界面。','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Select %s'=>'选择 %s','Invalid request.'=>'无效请求。','There\'s no content to scan.'=>'没有内容可供扫描。','There are no terms that are relevant to your content.'=>'没有与您的内容相关的术语。','This user does not have access to manage any of this post attached taxonomies. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'该用户没有权限管理此帖子附加的任何分类。请在 %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s 中为该角色启用 Metabox 访问分类。','No PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox features are enabled for this post type.'=>'此帖子类型未启用任何 PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox 功能。','Rename tab'=>'重命名标签','Save, You can also press Enter to save and escape to cancel'=>'保存，您也可以按 Enter 键保存，按 Esc 键取消','Search existing terms'=>'搜索现有术语','Search Terms...'=>'搜索术语...','Create term'=>'创建术语','Create Term'=>'创建术语','You do not have the required capabilities to manage any of this post attached taxonomies.'=>'您没有管理此帖子附加的任何分类所需的能力。','You can not edit this label.'=>'您无法编辑此标签。','Invalid nonce token.'=>'无效的 nonce 令牌。','Label is too long.'=>'标签太长。','Hey, you\'ve been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies growing.'=>'嘿，您在网站上使用 PublishPress Taxonomies 已经 %s 了。我们希望这个插件对您有所帮助。请您快速在 WordPress.org 上留下 5 星评价吗？这确实有助于 PublishPress Taxonomies 的发展。','1 week'=>'1 周','3 months'=>'3 个月','Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'点击这里添加您对 PublishPress Taxonomies 的评分','Maybe later'=>'也许稍后','I already did'=>'我已经评分了','PublishPress Taxonomies Free requires PHP 8.2 or newer. The plugin cannot run until PHP is updated.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Free 需要 PHP 8.2 或更新版本。在 PHP 更新之前，插件无法运行。','PublishPress Taxonomies Free requires WordPress 6.7 or newer. The plugin cannot run until WordPress is updated.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Free 需要 WordPress 6.7 或更新版本。在 WordPress 更新之前，插件无法运行。','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'此插件可以被删除。','PublishPress Taxonomies was not activated because PublishPress Taxonomies Pro is already active. Please keep only PublishPress Taxonomies Pro enabled.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 未被激活，因为 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 已经激活。请仅保留 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 启用。','term nameName'=>'名称','term nameTaxonomy'=>'taxonomy']];